  "title": "Basic Chocolate Drop Cookies",
  "description": "This recipe uses a pre-made mix that will keep for several weeks. You can look at the recipe for Basic Cookie Mix here at Allrecipes.com! Use 2 cups for this recipe. Add the following ingredients to the mix to make Chocolate Drop Cookies.",
